Hi <%= @first_name || "there" %>,

<%= @title %>

Somebody asked to reset the password for this account.
<%= if @body do %>

<%= @body %>
<% end %>

<%= facts_text(@facts) %>
<%= if @url do %>Choose a new password: <%= @url %><% end %>

The link works once and expires in an hour. If this wasn’t you, ignore this email: nothing has changed and your password still works.
